		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Gnome-sized faeries who dwell in rivers and streams, keeping them flowing and pristine. Shy but curious.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 4, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 dagger (close/near) +1 (1d4) or 1 crossbow (far) +1 (1d6) or 1 fey charm, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> -2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fey Charm</strong>. One LV 2 or less target within near, CHA 15+ or charmed for 1d4 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Nixie's Breath</strong>. With a touch, can bestow water breathing for 1d4 days.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
